<div class="agreement-page">
    <h2>Purchase Order Agreement</h2>
    <p><span class="clause-label">Fees:</span> There will be a 10% fuel surcharge imposed on all deliveries within 30 miles for orders of less than $1000.</p>
    <p><span class="clause-label">Payment terms:</span> A 50% deposit is required before production. Balance must be paid in full at the time of delivery or pickup. For all returned checks or rejected payments, there will be 30% penalty plus award of attorney's fees and costs incurred to collect the balance.</p>
    <p><span class="clause-label">Quotes:</span> All quotes are valid 30 days from the date of offer or until revocation, whichever is earlier. Prices are subject to change without further notice.</p>
    <p><span class="clause-label">Specifications:</span> Customers are responsible to verify and confirm the specifications of orders. EVWI is only responsible for specifications in writings. All the grids pattern in the pictures are for references ONLY.</p>
    <p><span class="clause-label">Suitability of usage:</span> EVWI is not responsible for the suitability of any products for any purpose or compliance with any regulations. Customers are responsible to verify all applicable requirements prior to ordering.</p>
    <p><span class="clause-label">Inspection:</span> Customers are responsible to inspect all visual defects at the time of pickup or delivery. Customers must inform EVWI in writing within 24 hours after delivery or pickup of any latent or other defects. If customer fails to notify EVWI of any problems within such time, customer is considered to have approved the merchandise ordered to be within its/his/her satisfaction, thus waive all claims against EVWI.</p>
    <p><span class="clause-label">Return &amp; Refund:</span> Once the order is confirmed and signed by the customer, there can be no changes, returns or refunds under any circumstances.</p>
    <p><span class="clause-label">Limitation of damages:</span> If any product is determined to be defective, EVWI shall repair or replace the defective product. EVWI shall allowed a minimum 5 working days opportunity to cure the defects or to make the new product. At no time shall EVWI be held responsible for any consequential damages including labor costs in the installation. Especially In the event of a installed defective product, EVWI will ONLY provide a replacement product subject to the its current product warranty policy. EVWI will NOT be responsible for the shipping costs and labor costs in the removal or re-installation of the product.</p>
    <p><span class="clause-label">Indemnification of claims:</span> If merchandise manufactured by EVWI is satisfactory to customer according to these terms and conditions, should any claims be filed by anyone or any entity regarding the merchandise, customer hereby agrees to indemnify EVWI against all claims.</p>
    <p><span class="clause-label">Serviceable Areas:</span> EVWI takes responsibility and offers services within the following counties, Santa Barbara, Kern (South of Bakersfield), Ventura, Los Angeles, San Bernardino, Orange, Riverside, and San Diego or within a 50 mile radius of our manufacturing facility, 11648 Washington Blvd., Whitter, CA 90606. For any cases outside of these limits, EVWI reserve all the rights and please contact EVWI if a service is needed.</p>
    <p><span class="clause-label">Disposal of Unclaimed Merchandise:</span> Due to storage constraints, merchandise will only be held in inventory for 30 days after the due date. If the merchandise has not been picked up 30 days after the due date, the merchandise will be disposed of and no claims for refunds of deposits/payments or replacement of merchandise may be made against EVWI.</p>
    <p><span class="clause-label">Glass:</span> GS Series windows and doors are covered by our full glass breakage protection warranty. Galaxy, Imperial, Luxury models are not warrantied against glass breakage.</p>
    <p><span class="clause-label">The View of the Product</span><br>
    The view of the picture is from the outside of the house toward inside.<br>
    The picture is for demonstration purposes only and may not be 100% identical to the real products.</p>
    <p>Our standard spacing between two adjacent grids ranges from 9" to 12" in width, 12" to 16" in height. You need to inform us before placing the order if your desired spacing is out of our range, and we will make the grids according to your custom size</p>

